      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. It's a little bit too \"safe\" though. Could you make the section about the punctuality a bit more direct? I don't want to sugarcoat it too much because it's actually starting to affect the rest of the team's workflow. Can you rewrite that part to be firmer about the expectation for being on time?",
